fa4b94bfe57ae23e.webp?t=1787930178\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393370/extras/1f6b1f160a3e36c5a23cf16b5d5591fc.poster.avif?t=1787930178\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393370/extras/1f6b1f160a3e36c5a23cf16b5d5591fc.webm?t=1787930178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393370/extras/1f6b1f160a3e36c5a23cf16b5d5591fc.mp4?t=1787930178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash your enemies with a complex yet accessible turn-based combat system! Thanks to a unique combat system you can experiment with Skills and Items combinations. Find overpowered combos and destroy everyone stupid enough to fight you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393370/extras/a2326ea6b924ebda12273d534d4f026c.webp?t=1787930178\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393370/extras/94515f22a03a6d9ad004cb8f783dd82f.poster.avif?t=1787930178\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393370/extras/94515f22a03a6d9ad004cb8f783dd82f.webm?t=1787930178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393370/extras/94515f22a03a6d9ad004cb8f783dd82f.mp4?t=1787930178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a stealth system to do anything you want. Steal something? Check! Assassinate someone? Check! Watch people sleep? Check! Pickpocket Marco during a quest and use his keys to rob his house while he's still kidnapped? Quite specific, but still doable! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Embark on an epic journey, enjoying complete freedom in a dynamic sandbox RPG. The world and its inhabitants will witness your deeds and react accordingly, adapting the narrative to your choices and delivering a truly unique and free experience.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Italian", "reviews": "“False flag operations and betrayals make backstabbing more than a flanking action in this sandbox CRPG.”<br>Dominic Tarason - PC Gamer<br><br>“A small Battle Brothers squad that can be used to do Bannerlord or Warband type things.”<br> SplatterCatGaming<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393370/747db0f88dfdba5919a3dec2006fadc110d1834f/header_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1787930178", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393370/b78d79ca142145ef2d24153f734400cfc4091435/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1787930178", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393370/b78d79ca142145ef2d24153f734400cfc4091435/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1787930178", "website": "https://www.innervoid.net", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8550U (4 * 1800) or equivalent / AMD Ryzen 7 2700U (4 * 2200) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia® GeForce GTX 660 / AMD Radeon HD 7870  / Intel Iris Pro 580 / Intel Iris Plus G7 / AMD Radeon Vega 11<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<b